# Production build settings. This file is COMMITTED on purpose.
#
# An empty base makes the app call the API with same-origin relative paths
# (/monitor/..., /projects/...), which nginx on the monitor host proxies to
# vaultwares-api. That keeps production off cross-origin requests entirely.
#
# It must stay committed: .env is gitignored, so a git worktree or a fresh
# clone never receives it, and a build from one silently fell back to the
# absolute https://api.vaultwares.ca default (see src/api.ts). Do not
# "simplify" the ?? in src/api.ts to || -- that would discard this empty
# value and reintroduce the absolute fallback.
VITE_MONITOR_API_BASE=
VITE_MONITOR_API_TARGET=https://api.vaultwares.ca
